Package: INLAcircular
Type: Package
Title: Bayesian Joint Circular Regression using 'INLA'
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Xiang",
    family = "Ye",
    email = "xiang.ye@kaust.edu.sa",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")
  )
Description: Provides a Bayesian regression framework for joint models with
    circular responses and covariates using integrated nested Laplace
    approximations. The package supports link-adjusted von Mises likelihoods,
    shared latent predictors, structured latent effects, and optional
    LKJ-based multivariate covariance models. It also provides compiled
    circular densities and d/p/q/r penalized-complexity priors for von Mises,
    cardioid, and wrapped Cauchy concentration parameters.
